": "ss2.png", "id": "421888538948247", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982542_421888542281580_7961047171456036679_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tUG-as4CQAAQ7kNvwF-FGEQ&_nc_oc=AdrT3Kah4xy6iMjPgvlZcXMfkX-Vs9BihmwzENKlKc1RhLk7Y0AaKMwa5qJtDlgcQ_o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSmv4mNpU8l1hvK9UuOCbHHJicV_j64CTKEUaFckEW56g&oe=6B09BBE2"}, {"file_name": "ss1.png", "id": "900672037137096", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57569452_900672040470429_3602208668542724751_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=y-huVFh7TD0Q7kNvwGgNWBO&_nc_oc=AdpvEbET9_T-4ZTf1ZhqiuXUuK17dg_M-AbxiH8mKmwR7Bb8wXIiOsF1u8feolFNJro&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ5YdAfuMVTJaReMRZ_OxbKvEG7k48bmN7giF-ucN6K6A&oe=6B09A336"}, {"file_name": "ss5.png", "id": "215595850179052", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036702_215595853512385_1516722769013058759_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mP7UYFJby14Q7kNvwHL1fvj&_nc_oc=AdoJDZhJEHnzpi8iZ-sGLyk_XIpmY5VM-9y1z22UNey069Elw78A7_O1qbjyLbvV9fE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSMH2enGGxy5B0Zo_qRqsybKsjbIKadhI5I5qyFeuuS3Q&oe=6B09AAA4"}, {"file_name": "ss4.png", "id": "416146802772950", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982521_416146806106283_7161111592696257607_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IaBMi9YK5MIQ7kNvwFLFv5N&_nc_oc=AdpVRYcW8b0bCYMQvV4X1m0EretsnWSN-vdpnZSx7fs_hXN3KKPLoxrTcOj_IsGlCag&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTtSsUHmQ5BYfxZsd_BaqjTt2Drrf7S0I5tMAQ1PWaMiQ&oe=6B09C850"}, {"file_name": "ss7.png", "id": "512472986379303", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031547_512472989712636_7638735751378089066_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CIOvIjk8_u4Q7kNvwHreUuA&_nc_oc=AdovnAwM5z6Ze6mq8fA_MeTr0G3iIig3buYC89kadXVXixraJta76wF5dLfdK3M83Oo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQU_tPcvxMC3hNTXiXu1nGgRblwKQRYvh2CXTET8IAr4w&oe=6B09C2E1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Counter Fight ICHIRAN", "keywords": ["ICHIRAN", "CounterFight", "JobSimulator", "Ramen", "cooking"], "long_description": "Make some mouth-watering ramen!\n\n\"Counter Fight ICHIRAN\" is an all-new cooking game created with input from popular ramen store, ICHIRAN.\n\nICHIRAN is a famous tonkotsu ramen chain with 85 outlets in Japan. Established over 60 years ago, it's been perfecting its hit specialty tonkotsu ramen for a long time, which is why ICHIRAN's ramen is the best in the land. In fact, it's often touted in the media as a \"must-try cuisine\" for foreign visitors.\n\nGame Features:\n\u30fbFulfill orders to get a high score! \nImmersive kitchen-based gameplay lets you experience life as a real ICHIRAN employee, racking up points for your ramen preparation skills and speedy delivery.\n\n\u30fbClimb the ranks in store management mode! \nYour score in store management mode is entered into a world ranking. Boost your profits to employ more staff and increase seating capacity as you try to hit the high scores with your own unique store!\n\n*In-game kitchen layout may differ from actual restaurants.", "short_description": "Cook some knockout noodles!\n\n\"Counter Fight ICHIRAN\" is an all-new cooking game made with input from popular ramen store, ICHIRAN.\n\nICHIRAN is a famous organic tonkotsu ramen chain with 85 outlets in Japan, often touted as a \"must-try cuisine\" for tourists. It has outlets in NY, Hong Kong, and Taiwan, too.\n\nFeatures:\n\u30fbFulfill orders to get a high score!\n\u30fbTake top place in store management mode!\n\u30fbBoost profits, employ more staff, up capacity, and hit the high scores with your own unique store!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "MiniLandscape.png", "id": "3838591046231584", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984462_3838591052898250_5002299579482394963_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MShPr58K_Y0Q7kNvwFT8fnD&_nc_oc=AdrS38ZGLfzII2DTdfqW3uHhO51vPEWNy1ahu45YY5orbeNcc0SRNYMLeszTC1sF-J8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQDLv57nS1Sq9qIjjhZL7veD8iNhYVZIqEUdl3IUvFhkw&oe=6B09AD9E"}, {"file_name": "CoverSquare.png", "id": "2182671695203710", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75641339_2182671698537043_1819436220465957851_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6jyTsySSmK8Q7kNvwFvvFaf&_nc_oc=AdrbJkJ2OfZOVz0GlEdvhheQh3EQH2MQghxBmxOQKiFzjVkEBbUvukMCnGs-yKr384c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQDK3I7cVRWTKOPZaEkVIP_80pOlAVkF2FQUT32NoJrqg&oe=6B09C33B"}, {"file_name": "icon.png", "id": "446502446404480", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75476755_446502449737813_695504826495623275_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bD91g_pAkN4Q7kNvwG9NmeL&_nc_oc=Adqjsw7-7qFB1ev-pZMIwbi0wvloLxB2lvCMJ7Hpn6PI7Y6vTFC-V2TFhcG8qfcv14M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRO0fkPbMIdxV9u3Ytcd0Xw7irYQAwQms50qvc8nS4FeA&oe=6B09AF61"}, {"file_name": "HeroCover.png", "id": "442920633578734", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75240108_442920636912067_8939691330164956004_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xWE34iNhjRQQ7kNvwH7Zh8R&_nc_oc=Adp4BY0quWvxGf0pnQD2HfVvL5WFlCaGqUZcVYIT0gvef_LJMwrEF7HAXTh_dYCcEXc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTCsgaMC3sesOHeBE-Yi2P9Nq8QC9-wXdey